@startuml Health Assistant Activity Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #E1F5FE
  BorderColor #0277BD
  StartColor #4CAF50
  EndColor #F44336
}

title Health Assistant System - Activity Diagram (Patient Report Upload & Doctor Review)

|Patient|
start
:Open Health Assistant App;
:Navigate to Reports Section;
:Click "Upload Report";

if (User Authenticated?) then (No)
  :Redirect to Login;
  :Enter Credentials;
  :Authenticate User;
else (Yes)
endif

:Select Report Type;
note right
  - Blood Test
  - X-Ray
  - MRI
  - CT Scan
  - Prescription
  - Other
end note

:Enter Report Title;
:Enter Report Description;
:Select Files to Upload;

if (Files Selected?) then (No)
  :Show Error Message;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|System|
:Validate File Types;
:Check File Sizes;

if (Files Valid?) then (No)
  |Patient|
  :Show Validation Error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

:Upload Files to Storage;
:Generate File URLs;
:Save Report to Database;

|Patient|
:Show Success Message;
:Display in My Reports;

|Doctor|
:Login to Doctor Portal;
:View Patient List;
:Select Patient;
:Navigate to Patient Details;

|System|
:Load Patient Information;
:Fetch Patient Reports;
:Display Reports List;

|Doctor|
:Click on Report;
:View Report Details;

if (Has Attachments?) then (Yes)
  :View/Download Files;
  :Analyze Medical Data;
else (No)
endif

:Create Diagnosis;
:Enter Diagnosis Text;
:Add Recommendations;
:Save Diagnosis;

|System|
:Store Diagnosis;
:Link to Patient Record;
:Update Patient History;

|Patient|
:Receive Notification;
:View Updated Diagnosis;

|AI System|
if (Patient Uses Chatbot?) then (Yes)
  :Process Health Query;
  :Analyze Symptoms;
  :Generate AI Response;
  :Provide Health Guidance;
  
  if (Serious Symptoms?) then (Yes)
    :Recommend Doctor Visit;
  else (No)
    :Provide General Advice;
  endif
else (No)
endif

stop

note right of "Upload Files to Storage"
  Files are stored in Supabase Storage
  with proper security policies.
  Only authorized users can access.
end note

note right of "Create Diagnosis"
  Doctors can create multiple
  diagnoses for the same patient.
  All diagnoses are tracked
  in patient history.
end note

note right of "Process Health Query"
  AI chatbot powered by Gemini
  provides health information
  but always recommends
  professional medical advice.
end note

@enduml